# Anti-spoof calibration scratch. `logs/` IS tracked — those captures are the evidence
# behind the CALIBRATION table in LivenessFusion.kt and scripts/calibrate_anti_spoof.py
# cannot be re-run without them. What is ignored here is only working scratch: the
# upstream Silent-Face-Anti-Spoofing checkout and its sample images, pulled down to
# verify the [0,255] BGR input contract, plus Python bytecode.
.tmp/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
